---
import Base from "../../../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="冲孔板 — 规格、价格与安平工厂" description="冲孔金属板用于过滤、建筑及工业。圆孔、方孔与长圆孔，材质规格，安平工厂直供。" lang="zh">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-8">
    <!-- Main Content -->
    <article class="flex-1 min-w-0 prose">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-theme-primary">冲孔板</h1>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary">冲孔板是在金属板上冲压出精确孔型的板材。安平工厂生产各类冲孔板，用于过滤、筛分、建筑幕墙、吸音板、机器防护及装饰，材质包括钢、不锈钢、铝及特种合金。</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary">材质</h2>
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>材料</th><th>常用牌号</th><th>板厚</th><th>适用场景</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>低碳钢</td><td>Q235, SPCC</td><td>0.5–6.0mm</td><td>通用工业、过滤</td></tr>
          <tr><td>镀锌钢</td><td>DX51D, SGCC</td><td>0.5–3.0mm</td><td>户外、耐腐蚀</td></tr>
          <tr><td>不锈钢</td><td>304, 316, 430</td><td>0.3–5.0mm</td><td>食品、化工、制药</td></tr>
          <tr><td>铝合金</td><td>1060, 3003, 5052</td><td>0.3–4.0mm</td><td>建筑、轻量化</td></tr>
          <tr><td>铜 / 黄铜</td><td>C11000, H62, H65</td><td>0.3–2.0mm</td><td>装饰、吸音、电磁屏蔽</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary">常用规格</h2>
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>孔型</th><th>孔径 (mm)</th><th>孔距 (mm)</th><th>板厚 (mm)</th><th>开孔率 %</th><th>用途</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>圆孔错排</td><td>0.8–25.4</td><td>1.5–35</td><td>0.3–3.0</td><td>20–70%</td><td>过滤、筛分</td></tr>
          <tr><td>圆孔直排</td><td>1.0–30</td><td>2.0–40</td><td>0.5–4.0</td><td>15–60%</td><td>格栅、通风</td></tr>
          <tr><td>方孔</td><td>2×2–50×50</td><td>3–60</td><td>0.5–4.0</td><td>20–65%</td><td>隔断、吊顶</td></tr>
          <tr><td>长圆孔</td><td>0.8×10–5×50</td><td>2–60</td><td>0.5–4.0</td><td>15–55%</td><td>筛板、干燥机</td></tr>
          <tr><td>六角孔</td><td>3–25</td><td>4–35</td><td>0.5–3.0</td><td>30–75%</td><td>建筑、吸音</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <p class="text-sm text-theme-muted">标准板材尺寸：1000×2000mm、1220×2440mm、1250×2500mm、1500×3000mm，可定制。<a href="/zh/tools/woven-wire-mesh-weight-calculator/" class="text-theme-accent">估算重量 →</a></p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary">订货时需要说明</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>材质和牌号（如 SS304、3003 铝、Q235）</li>
        <li>孔型、孔径及排列方式（错排或直排）</li>
        <li>板厚和板材尺寸</li>
        <li>开孔率或孔隙度要求</li>
        <li>表面处理方式：原板、抛光、喷塑、阳极氧化</li>
        <li>边缘留边：标准留边或定制</li>
        <li>数量（m² 或张数）</li>
      </ol>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary">价格参考</h2>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-4">
        <table class="w-full text-sm border-collapse">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">产品</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">规格</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">价格范围 (USD/m²)</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">起订量</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">交期</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">低碳钢冲孔板</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">圆孔 3mm，孔距 5mm，1.0mm 厚</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">$12–22/m²</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">50 m²</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">10–15 天</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">镀锌冲孔板</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">圆孔 5mm，孔距 8mm，1.0mm 厚</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">$15–28/m²</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">50 m²</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">12–18 天</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">SS304 冲孔板</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">圆孔 2mm，孔距 4mm，1.0mm 厚</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">$30–55/m²</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">30 m²</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">15–25 天</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">铝冲孔板</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">圆孔 3mm，孔距 5mm，1.0mm 厚</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">$25–45/m²</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">50 m²</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">15–22 天</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">建筑定制图案</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">定制图案，喷塑处理</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">$45–120/m²</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">20 m²</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">25–40 天</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-theme-muted mb-6">*2025–2026 年参考价格。实际价格取决于材料成本、孔型复杂度、模具费用、订单量及表面处理方式。请务必索取正式报价。</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary">常见问题</h2>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">错排和直排孔型有什么区别？</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary">错排：孔在交替行中错位排列，开孔率最大、强度最好，过滤和筛分最常用。直排：孔按行列对齐，外观更整洁，适合建筑和装饰。错排通常生产成本更低。</p>
      </details>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">开孔率选多少合适？</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary">开孔率越高，通风越好，强度越低。过滤：30–50%。扬声器格栅：40–60%。吸音板：50–70%。建筑遮阳：30–50%。安全防护：20–40% 保证强度。</p>
      </details>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">能定制孔型或 Logo 吗？</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary">可以。数控冲床和激光切割支持定制孔型、图案和 Logo。独特冲型需要模具费，起订量通常更高（100+ m²）。建筑项目常用定制图案。</p>
      </details>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">圆孔开孔率怎么计算？</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary">错排圆孔：开孔率 ≈ 0.905 × (d/t)² × 100%，d = 孔径，t = 孔距（中心到中心）。例如：3mm 孔、5mm 孔距 = 0.905 × (3/5)² = 32.6% 开孔率。</p>
      </details>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">冲孔板最薄能做多厚？</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary">激光切割不锈钢和铝可达 0.3mm。标准冲床适用 0.5–6.0mm。更薄的板容易变形，需要小心操作。结构用途建议 1.5mm 以上。</p>
      </details>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">冲孔板能折弯、卷圆或焊接吗？</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary">可以。冲孔板可折弯成型、卷成圆筒、焊接。注意：靠近孔位焊接可能变形。圆筒过滤器需说明是预卷板还是冲孔后卷圆。通常先加工后喷塑。</p>
      </details>

      <div class="not-prose mt-8 bg-theme-secondary text-white rounded-xl p-6">
        <p class="font-semibold text-lg">获取安平冲孔板工厂报价</p>
        <a href="/zh/inquiry/" class="inline-block mt-3 accent-bg hover:accent-bg font-semibold px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg transition-colors">发送询盘 →</a>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- Sidebar -->
    <aside class="lg:w-80 shrink-0">
      <div class="sticky top-24 space-y-6">
        <!-- Quick Tools -->
        <div class="bg-theme-card border border-theme rounded-lg p-5">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-theme-accent tracking-widest mb-3">快捷工具</p>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-theme-primary mb-3">计算与换算</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
            <li>
              <a href="/zh/tools/woven-wire-mesh-weight-calculator/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> 重量计算器
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/zh/tools/container-loading-calculator/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> 集装箱装载计算器
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/zh/tools/fob-price-calculator/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> FOB 价格计算器
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/zh/tools/inquiry-template-generator/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> 询盘模板生成器
              </a>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Quick Specs -->
        <div class="bg-theme-card border border-theme rounded-lg p-5">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-theme-accent tracking-widest mb-3">快速规格</p>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-theme-primary mb-3">冲孔板标准</h3>
          <dl class="space-y-2 text-xs">
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <dt class="text-theme-muted">孔径</dt>
              <dd class="text-theme-primary">0.3–50 mm</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <dt class="text-theme-muted">板厚</dt>
              <dd class="text-theme-primary">0.3–6.0 mm</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <dt class="text-theme-muted">开孔率</dt>
              <dd class="text-theme-primary">15–75%</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <dt class="text-theme-muted">板材尺寸</dt>
              <dd class="text-theme-primary">1000×2000–1500×3000</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <dt class="text-theme-muted">材质</dt>
              <dd class="text-theme-primary">钢 / 不锈钢 / 铝 / 铜 / 黄铜</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <dt class="text-theme-muted">标准</dt>
              <dd class="text-theme-primary">ISO 7801<br/>ASTM E2016</dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
        </div>

        <!-- Related Products -->
        <div class="bg-theme-card border border-theme rounded-lg p-5">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-theme-accent tracking-widest mb-3">相关产品</p>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-theme-primary mb-3">相关产品</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
            <li>
              <a href="/zh/products/expanded-metal/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> 钢板网
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/zh/products/stainless-steel-wire-mesh/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> 不锈钢丝网
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/zh/products/welded-wire-mesh/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> 焊接网
              </a>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>
</Base>